meta {
  name: HN Scraper BFF
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  Manual E2E against a live local Nest BFF. Run HP1 before HP2/HP3/HP4/HP5/E2 so `accessToken` is set.
  HP4/HP5 save+list use fixture entries (no live HN). E3 last: it spends the throttle window.
  CI runs a subset via `@usebruno/cli` (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`).
}
